---
import EnquirySection from '../../components/EnquirySection.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { canonicalPages } from '../../lib/site-pages';
const metadata = canonicalPages.find((page) => page.path === '/contact/')!;
---

<BaseLayout title={metadata.title} description={metadata.description} canonicalPath={metadata.path}>
  <section class="contact-page">
    <div class="shell contact-intro">
      <h1>Contact Hyper Florist</h1>
      <p>Questions, feedback, corrections, or collaboration notes are welcome here. This form is for reaching the team, not for collecting leads or purchase enquiries.</p>
      <p>If you noticed an outdated guide, want to suggest a florist topic, found a broken page, or need to clarify something published on the site, send a short note and include the page or context that prompted it.</p>
      <p>Helpful messages usually include the page URL, the sentence or detail you are referring to, and what you expected to find instead. For topic suggestions, mention the occasion, recipient, flower, plant, or Singapore-specific situation you want covered so the guide can be researched and written with the right context.</p>
      <p>You can also flag accessibility problems, confusing navigation, missing sources, unclear cultural notes, image issues, or internal links that no longer point to the best guide.</p>
      <p>For privacy, avoid sending payment details, recipient addresses, order instructions, or sensitive personal information. A simple message with enough context is usually the most useful starting point.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <EnquirySection />
</BaseLayout>
